    apply: "If you sense a call to cross-cultural work, speak to your pastor and a mature believer and begin a plan: short-term experience, training, prayer partners. If not, commit to support someone who goes. Pray Isaiah 6:8 honestly. Memorise Isaiah 6:8.",
